		(property "Description" "Mating DB37 male connector for the ACCES I/O USB-AO16-8A analog-output DAC's J1 (DB37 female, 'Analog Outputs'). Pin table is the manufacturer's own (USB-AO16-16A User Manual, Chapter 6, Table 6-1/6-2; the -8A this board uses shares the same connector and pin map, populated to DAC0-DAC7 of the 16 available). Brings in the board's six eye channels (spec Sec.3.2)."
